\@add@centering\end{subfigure}\par\@@toccaption{{\lx@tag[ ]{{6}}{
{Pass@$k$ optimization hurts pass@1 performance: Gradient conflict across two models.}
Both models demonstrate how pass@$k$ reweighting causes gradient conflict with pass@1, despite different threshold settings.
Agreement scores are computed relative to the pass@1 gradient of filtered prompts.
