{(b) DeepSeek-Qwen:} The \emph{dramatic downward shift} from $+2.97\times 10^{-2}$ to $-2.74\times 10^{-1}$ ($\Delta=-3.04\times 10^{-1}$) demonstrates even stronger gradient conflict. Despite only 29 hard prompts vs 627 easy (21.6:1 ratio), the extreme weight disparity causes hard negatives to completely dominate, resulting in inner product $-181$.
