</table></mtext><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic"> Taking the operator norm and using the triangular inequality yields: </mtext><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">
<table class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
